@startuml UC28B_GuestDetail
!theme plain
title UC28B: Xem chi tiết khách

actor Staff as "Staff/Admin"
participant "Admin Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Database" as DB

Staff -> Frontend: Click vào khách trong danh sách
Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/bookings/:bookingId\n(Authorization: Bearer token)\n(populate guests, roomId, customerId)

API -> API: Verify JWT + Check role (staff/admin)
API -> DB: Tìm booking theo ID\n(populate guests, roomId, customerId, services)

alt Booking không tồn tại
    DB --> API: Booking not found
    API --> Frontend: Error: 404
    Frontend --> Staff: Hiển thị lỗi
else Booking tồn tại
    DB --> API: Booking data với guests array
    
    API -> API: Extract guest info\n(fullName, idNumber, dateOfBirth, phoneNumber, email, isMainGuest)
    API -> DB: Query booking history\n(filter: guests chứa guest info)
    DB --> API: Related bookings
    
    API --> Frontend: Success + guest detail + booking history
    Frontend --> Staff: Hiển thị chi tiết khách\n(hồ sơ, thông tin liên hệ, ghi chú, lịch sử booking)
end
@enduml

